ng flat. Or just saying they return to hand as an excuse not to track ammo.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-25T05:15:28-07:00","id":1410269,"title":"","content":"\u201c<i>How</i> many boomerangs do you have on you?\u201d<br /> \u201cUh... As many as until I fail an ammo check?\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-25T06:26:58-07:00","id":1410274,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1409895-thrown-confusion?p=1410269#post1410269\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u201c<i>How</i> many boomerangs do you have on you?\u201d<br /> \u201cUh... As many as until I fail an ammo check?\u201d</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly what I was thinking...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-25T06:38:44-07:00","id":1410276,"title":"","content":"But...boomerangs come back. Like even mundane ones come back with a pretty easy thrown check. If you need more than two boomerangs you shouldn\u2019t be looking into coats to hold more boomerangs you should be looking into throwing lessons.<br /> <br /> Edit: ahhh the mundane ones only come back if they miss, right right. The artifact ones come back if they hit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1121,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","user":"DrLoveMonkey","date":". 08-25-2020, 09:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-25T06:55:56-07:00","id":1410280,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1409895-thrown-confusion?p=1410248#post1410248\" rel=\"nofollow\" ti